WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.634
Cat followed Dirk to the Grim Dungeon.

2
00:00:12.635 --> 00:00:18.519
Water dripped from the ceiling.

3
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.388
Dirk found the king locked up.

4
00:00:21.389 --> 00:00:27.857
"Your Majesty!" he cried.

5
00:00:27.858 --> 00:00:32.353
"I will free you!"

6
00:00:32.354 --> 00:00:35.806
Suddenly Daimon stepped out of the darkness.

7
00:00:35.807 --> 00:00:41.191
"I don't think so!"

8
00:00:41.192 --> 00:00:47.975
He pointed his wand at Dirk. Poof!

9
00:00:47.976 --> 00:00:53.657
Now Dirk was locked up too!

10
00:00:53.658 --> 00:00:56.874
Water dripped onto Daimon's hand.

11
00:00:56.875 --> 00:01:01.321
"Ack! I don't like water!" he cried.

12
00:01:01.322 --> 00:01:04.672
He quickly wiped it off.

13
00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:09.119
Cat licked her paw and watched.

14
00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:17.369
"Now I will take over the castle!" Daimon said.

15
00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.821
He rushed toward the Throne Room.

16
00:01:19.822 --> 00:01:23.079
Cat followed quietly.

17
00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:26.767
Everyone was gathered in the Throne Room.

18
00:01:26.768 --> 00:01:31.518
They were making plans to fight Daimon.

19
00:01:31.519 --> 00:01:35.172
Boom! The door flew open.

20
00:01:35.173 --> 00:01:39.787
It was Daimon!

21
00:01:39.788 --> 00:01:42.389
Ann pointed her wand at him.

22
00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:45.529
"We're going to stop you!" said Ann.

23
00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:48.364
"You'll never take over the castle."

24
00:01:48.365 --> 00:01:53.011
Daimon just laughed.

25
00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:56.633
"You think you're going to fight me.

26
00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:59.879
But you're all going to sleep!"

27
00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.191
Daimon flicked his wand.

28
00:02:02.192 --> 00:02:04.156
Cat leaped at Tom.

29
00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:09.753
Tom stumbled just as Daimon cast his spell.

30
00:02:09.754 --> 00:02:12.885
Ann fell asleep.

31
00:02:12.886 --> 00:02:16.109
So did the guards and the servants.

32
00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.902
But Tom lay on the floor, still awake.

33
00:02:19.903 --> 00:02:25.391
Daimon laughed with glee.

34
00:02:25.392 --> 00:02:28.299
"My sleeping spell worked.

35
00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:36.435
Now the castle is mine—all mine!"

